  "description": "Su-Hyeon has a loving boyfriend, Hae-Min, but the passion’s gone cold. Haunted by dreams of being taken rough and without restraint, Su-Hyeon can’t shake the hunger that gnaws at him. Then one night at a bar, he meets a man who embodies everything he’s been craving: sharp eyes, a dangerous smile, and a touch that leaves him trembling. As Su-Hyeon falls deeper into the affair, Hae-Min discovers the truth, and what follows is a story of love, lust, and betrayal—perfectly arranged in threes.\n\n(Source: Lezhin US)",
